CompileTimeError: d138_looping_over_a_map_hash_is_refused.jern:3:19, line 3 column 19
 3 |     for $entry in $ages:
   |                   ^^^^^
 what: a `Map.hash` has no order to rely on, so it can't be looped over; `.keys.sorted()` gives an order
 why:  looping over a `Map.hash` is refused (D138, standard 13.3)
